The '''HHMods Perks''' plugin (part of the [[HHMods]] suite) adds five community perks to the base game's [[Perks|skill system]]. Each hooks into a different game manager or damage / crafting pipeline.

== Perks added ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Perk !! Tree !! Effect
|-
| '''[[Alchemist]]''' || Craft || Chance to double output at [[Biochemical Workbench]] and [[Campfire]].
|-
| '''[[Metallurgist]]''' || Craft || Chance to double output at [[Furnace]].
|-
| '''[[Geologist]]''' || Survive || Reveals nearby ore veins on the [[HHMods Minimap|minimap]]. Soft-requires [[HHMods Minimap]] to visualize.
|-
| '''[[Panning Out]]''' || Survive || Chance for bonus resources when mining terrain (postfixes <code>Terrain_Dig.Dig_Terrain</code>).
|-
| '''[[Pitcher]]''' || Fight || Increases throwing range and damage. Consumed by throwable weapons in [[HHMods Weapons]].
|}

== Technical ==

Each perk is registered at plugin startup via <code>HHMods.Core.PerkRegistry.Register</code>. The perks are added to <code>All_Skills_Set._SurviveSkills</code>, <code>_CraftSkills</code>, or <code>_FightSkills</code> according to tree.

Cross-plugin softness:

* '''Geologist''' checks for <code>HHMods.Minimap.LayerService</code> via reflection. Without it, the perk still exists but the ore layer isn't visualized.
* '''Pitcher''' exposes a runtime factor field on <code>Char_Skills</code>. Throwing Axe and other throwables in [[HHMods Weapons]] read this factor if the perk is installed.

